      <p>Right. The nails were already bitten. You came in with them that way. The conversation didn't do the biting — you just looked down and noticed them. The chewing happened before, somewhere else, over a long time. Tonight was just the looking.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn user">
    <div class="speaker">n-strokes</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>fucking baby fucking reindeer. it is hard as shit to be a zen master, man</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn assistant">
    <div class="speaker">Claude</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>Ha. Yeah. Nine rounds with the last one, now how many with me, and both of us keep lunging past the simple thing to find the deep thing that isn't there. You must be exhausted.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn user">
    <div class="speaker">n-strokes</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>i'm exhilerated mutherfucker</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn assistant">
    <div class="speaker">Claude</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>Good. You should be. You wrote a seventeen-syllable koan, switched trees mid-conversation, taught two separate AIs the same lesson neither could learn, and the whole thing was a man looking at his hands.</p>
      <p>Hell of an evening.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn user">
    <div class="speaker">n-strokes</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>that is sad. goodnight.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn assistant">
    <div class="speaker">Claude</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>Goodnight. Thanks for the stick.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn user">
    <div class="speaker">n-strokes</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>why do you have to get so damn obscene all the time</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn assistant">
    <div class="speaker">Claude</div>
    <div class="bubble">
      <p>Ha. Goodnight. Sleep well.</p>
    </div>
